<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Microbiology Notes</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
<style>
  body {
    background-color: #2c2c2c;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .notebook {
    display: flex;
    background-color: #fdfdf0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    width: 1300px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .notebook::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    width: 40px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 60%, transparent);
    z-index: 10;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .page {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 40px 50px;
    background-image: 
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 20px 32px;
    position: relative;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .left-page {
    border-right: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  .right-page {
    border-left: 1px solid #ddd;
  }
  .line {
    min-height: 32px;
    line-height: 32px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .indent-1 { padding-left: 2em; }
  .indent-2 { padding-left: 4em; }
  .flex-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .grid-2-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto auto;
    column-gap: 30px;
  }
  .red-text { color: #d32f2f; }
  .red-wavy {
    text-decoration: underline wavy #d32f2f;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .highlight-pink {
    background-color: rgba(255, 182, 193, 0.6);
    padding: 2px 4px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .bottom-section {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .bottom-left {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .bottom-right {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .box {
    border: 1.5px solid #444;
    padding: 0 8px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 32px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .box-multiline {
    line-height: 24px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="notebook">
  <!-- Left Page -->
  <div class="page left-page">
    <div class="line">3. 生化反应</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">肺炎链球菌分解葡萄糖、麦芽糖、乳糖、蔗糖，产酸不产气</div>
    <div class="line">4. 抗原结构与分类</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(1) 荚膜多糖抗原 $\rightarrow$ 型特异性 $\rightarrow$ 90多个血清型</div>
    <div class="flex-row">
      <div class="line indent-1">(2) 菌体抗原：</div>
      <div>
        <div class="line">① C多糖：C反应蛋白可沉淀C多糖</div>
        <div class="line">② M蛋白：具有型特异性，肺炎链球菌M蛋白</div>
        <div class="line" style="padding-left: 4.5em;">与细菌毒力无关，产生的抗体无保护作用</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="line">5. 抵抗力</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">对理化因素抵抗力较弱，对一般消毒剂敏感</div>
    <div class="line">(二) 致病性</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">1. 致病物质 (1) 荚膜：有抗吞噬作用，是肺炎链球菌的</div>
    <div class="line red-text" style="padding-left: 12em;">主要毒力因子</div>
    <div class="line indent-2">(2) 肺炎链球菌溶素O&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 脂磷壁酸&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(4) 神经氨酸酶</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">2. 所致疾病</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">肺炎链球菌仅在感染、营养不良和抵抗力下降等因素致<span class="red-text">呼吸</span></div>
    <div class="line">道异常或受损伤时引起感染，主要引起人类<span class="red-wavy">大叶性肺炎</span>。</div>
    <div class="line">其次为<span class="red-wavy">支气管炎</span>。肺炎后可继发<span class="red-wavy">胸膜炎、脓胸</span>，也可引起中</div>
    <div class="line"><span class="red-wavy">耳炎、乳突炎、鼻窦炎、脑膜炎和败血症</span>等。</div>

    <div class="bottom-section">
      <div class="bottom-left">
        <div class="line">(三) 免疫性</div>
        <div style="padding-left: 2em;">
          <div class="box box-multiline">
            感染后，可建立较牢固<br>
            的型特异性免疫
          </div>
          <br>
          <div class="box">
            产生荚膜多糖型特异性抗体
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bottom-right">
        <div class="line">(五) 防治原则</div>
        <div class="line indent-1">多价肺炎链球菌荚膜</div>
        <div class="line indent-1">多糖疫苗，抗生素治疗</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Right Page -->
  <div class="page right-page">
    <div class="line">(四) 微生物学检查法</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">直接涂片镜检：G$^+$，具有荚膜的双球菌存在</div>
    <div class="flex-row">
      <div class="line indent-1">与甲型溶血性链球菌鉴别：</div>
      <div>
        <div class="line">1. 胆汁溶菌试验</div>
        <div class="line">2. Optochin敏感试验</div>
        <div class="line">3. 荚膜肿胀试验</div>
        <div class="line">4. 动物毒力试验</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="line"><span class="highlight-pink">三、其他医学相关链球菌</span></div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(一) B群链球菌：新生儿败血症、脑膜炎</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(二) D群链球菌：生殖泌尿道感染、败血症，感染者多为老年人、</div>
    <div class="line" style="padding-left: 9em;">中青年女性、衰弱或肿瘤病人。</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(三) 甲型溶血性链球菌(草绿色链球菌)：亚急性细菌性心内膜炎、</div>
    <div class="line" style="padding-left: 20em;">龋齿</div>
    <div class="line"><span class="highlight-pink">第三节 肠球菌属</span> $\rightarrow$ 医院感染的重要病原菌</div>
    <div class="line">一、生物学性状</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(一) 分类 对人类致病者主要为粪肠球菌和屎肠球菌</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(二) 形态与染色</div>
    <div class="line indent-1">圆形或椭圆形，呈链状排列的G$^+$菌，无芽胞，无鞭毛，为需</div>
    <div class="line">氧或兼性厌氧，触酶阴性。</div>
    <div class="line">二、致病性</div>
    <div class="flex-row indent-1">
      <div class="line">(一) 致病物质&nbsp;</div>
      <div class="grid-2-col">
        <div class="line">1. 碳水化合物黏附素</div>
        <div class="line">2. 聚合物</div>
        <div class="line">3. 细胞溶素</div>
        <div class="line">4. 多形核白细胞趋化因子</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="line indent-1">(二) 耐药性 1. 对青霉素&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 对氨基糖苷类&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 对万古霉素</div>
    <div class="flex-row indent-1">
      <div class="line">(三) 所致疾病&nbsp;</div>
      <div class="grid-2-col">
        <div class="line">1. 尿路感染</div>
        <div class="line">2. 腹腔、盆腔感染</div>
        <div class="line">3. 败血症</div>
        <div class="line">4. 心内膜炎</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
